    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n516" root="ار" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِئْرٌّ</span></b>  A man (S,) <i>much addicted to venery:</i> (S,
K:) so accord. to A'Obeyd, as related by Sh and
El-Iyádee, but thought by Az to be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَئِيرٌ</span>, of the
same measure as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعِيرٌ</span>, i. e., <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْعِلٌ</span>, [originally
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَأْيِرٌ</span>,] from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آرَهَا</span>. (T.)

